Comment: 0,0:11:24.28,0:11:38.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Comment: 0,0:01:05.25,0:01:07.79,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{Opening}
Comment: 0,0:23:00.33,0:23:12.84,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{Ending}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.06,0:00:14.21,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh no, more leaves!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.69,0:00:17.41,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Cleaning up tomorrow morning is going to be difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.17,0:00:20.41,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I'll bet {\i1}that's{\i0} difficult too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.41,0:00:21.43,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.81,0:00:31.76,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka... 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.86,0:00:39.81,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Is there nothing I can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.36,0:00:43.62,Default,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.62,0:00:45.35,Default,Chise,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome back!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.35,0:00:46.65,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.93,0:00:49.61,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Did you all go out together?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.00,0:00:55.06,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,Yes. You see, their school had a bazaar today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.06,0:00:55.86,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Bazaar?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.60,0:00:58.71,Default,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,It's where everyone brings all sorts of things,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.71,0:01:01.81,Default,Chise,0000,0000,0000,,and sells them for the sake of the school!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.81,0:01:03.14,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.14,0:01:04.58,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.61,0:02:43.64,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Bazaar!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.00,0:02:48.58,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka, let's have a bazaar!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.58,0:02:48.98,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.98,0:02:53.15,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Let's sell a ton of stuff and pay back the debt collector!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.11,0:02:56.00,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato... 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.44,0:03:01.20,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,If we pay back the loan, we won't be\Nevicted and everything will be okay, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.04,0:03:04.98,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.98,0:03:06.41,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Let's do it, let's have a bazaar!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.81,0:03:08.09,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato, you see—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.09,0:03:10.35,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,If the loan was something that\Ncould've been paid off that easily,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.35,0:03:11.96,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,it would've been taken care of a long time ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.71,0:03:14.09,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.09,0:03:21.15,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,You do something like that at a big school,\Nnot a little nursery with only a few students.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.15,0:03:22.47,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,We wouldn't get that much money.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.02,0:03:24.43,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,So doing that here would be pointless.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.57,0:03:39.62,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry for causing such a fuss...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.62,0:03:41.94,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'll go clean up outside, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.21,0:03:51.02,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,To be all enthusiastic and go all out holding a bazaar is just like her... 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.02,0:03:55.67,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,But when things don't work out, she'll be upset too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.10,0:03:58.92,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,So I understand your desire to make her give up that idea,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.68,0:04:01.55,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,but you shouldn't put it like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.27,0:04:07.41,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,If you're too brusque about\Nthings, it'll look like you're bullying.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.30,0:04:26.64,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I... 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.60,0:04:34.70,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I got all worked up by myself...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.95,0:04:40.34,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Both Fujimoto and Miss Sayaka were shocked, weren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.93,0:04:46.09,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm such an idiot, aren't I... 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.15,0:04:49.70,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I suppose you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.07,0:04:54.60,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,But I don't think it's bad to be so determined.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.96,0:05:00.68,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.69,0:05:05.11,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,D-Don't hug me! You—!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.59,0:05:07.62,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.03,0:05:15.46,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.01,0:05:18.46,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Let's do it. Let's have a bazaar!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.71,0:05:20.54,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.21,0:05:23.05,Default,Yuzuru,0000,0000,0000,,Bazaar?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.41,0:05:29.05,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,It's where you bring in no longer needed or handmade things from home and sell them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.05,0:05:30.89,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,It's like playing store!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.89,0:05:32.77,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,I want to be in charge of the yakisoba stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.76,0:05:35.41,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,That's a good idea too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.80,0:05:38.27,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I've written down the details in your correspondence books.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.65,0:05:40.38,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Make sure you show your folks at home, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.38,0:05:41.28,Default,Children,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.28,0:05:44.87,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Let's do our best! Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.63,0:05:44.87,Default Alt,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.36,0:05:49.75,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,It's good that Kobato's happy again, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.75,0:05:52.08,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I couldn't care less.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.08,0:05:56.21,Default,Child,0000,0000,0000,,Bye bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.21,0:05:58.43,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka, see you tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.43,0:06:00.04,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,See you tomorrow, goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.41,0:06:04.52,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Bazaar!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.81,0:06:10.14,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.14,0:06:11.55,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Mr. Doggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.55,0:06:12.40,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,And that one?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.40,0:06:13.96,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Kitty!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.57,0:06:19.26,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you feel bad for the cat and the dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.07,0:06:25.86,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,He got you there. That's why you have no answer, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.98,0:06:29.53,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for your hard work!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.48,0:06:33.54,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.44,0:06:36.47,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Did you draw this, Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.47,0:06:37.04,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.00,0:06:39.47,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,You're good at this, aren't you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.40,0:06:45.59,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Really! What an adorable duck\Nand sheep you have drawn here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.29,0:06:51.66,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Then, I'll be excusing myself first.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.13,0:06:52.97,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Do you have work?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.31,0:06:54.19,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.39,0:06:56.97,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Don't push yourself too hard, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.94,0:06:59.16,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.58,0:07:04.00,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka, you too. Don't push yourself too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.81,0:07:12.23,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,So that's what Fujimoto\Nlooks like when he smiles... 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.66,0:07:25.53,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Then if you'll excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.89,0:07:29.63,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,How childish of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.77,0:07:33.39,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,He must've taken a liking to you, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.39,0:07:34.83,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.83,0:07:36.18,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.18,0:07:40.39,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,It's impossible for both Fujimoto and that other guy to just be straightforward about things.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.10,0:07:42.14,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,The other guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.83,0:07:46.36,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Oh! Ah, thank you for your work today, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.03,0:07:50.35,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Let's continue preparing for the bazaar tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.74,0:08:04.52,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Do you think she was talking about her husband?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.58,0:08:10.63,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,If I remember correctly, you ordered a birthday cake for your husband here before, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.02,0:08:13.04,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Right... 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.46,0:08:17.55,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Could be I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.55,0:08:22.06,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder what she meant when she said that it's impossible for him to just be straightforward.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.73,0:08:23.85,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.16,0:08:25.45,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It's a mystery.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.45,0:08:27.97,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Less of a mystery than your pictures, Dobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.42,0:08:31.61,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,That's mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.31,0:08:39.01,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone, thank you all so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.01,0:08:39.41,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.32,0:08:44.58,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.58,0:08:46.25,Default,Yuzuru,0000,0000,0000,,A weather fortune doll!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.49,0:08:48.19,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Weather fortune doll?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.19,0:08:51.83,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,You make it and hang it up and wish for good weather!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.83,0:08:53.76,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder who brought them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.84,0:08:58.12,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Did you make them, Naomi? {tomoyo!}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.62,0:08:59.76,Default,Naomi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.37,0:09:04.65,Default,Naomi,0000,0000,0000,,The weather fortune dolls I made... they bring a lot of sunny days.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.65,0:09:08.27,Default,Naomi,0000,0000,0000,,Field trip days and pool days are always sunny.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.70,0:09:11.53,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What amazing weather fortune dolls!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.32,0:09:14.03,Default,Naomi,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if they'll sell... 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.27,0:09:15.48,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,They will!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.48,0:09:19.53,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I also made something to sell. Let's line them up and sell them together!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.88,0:09:21.04,Default,Naomi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.34,0:09:25.37,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,All right then, let's put price tags on the things you all brought in today!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.87,0:09:26.68,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.68,0:09:27.95,Default,Naomi,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.73,0:09:33.13,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.13,0:09:37.86,Default,Naomi,0000,0000,0000,,The nursery won't close if we sell a lot of weather fortune dolls, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.86,0:09:39.39,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, don't worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.89,0:09:42.55,Default,Naomi,0000,0000,0000,,You know... my mommy...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.80,0:09:46.60,Default,Naomi,0000,0000,0000,,She's going to have a baby soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.22,0:09:49.06,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.06,0:09:50.73,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.73,0:09:51.85,Default,Naomi,0000,0000,0000,,So you see... 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.73,0:09:57.36,Default,Naomi,0000,0000,0000,,Mommy's going to take off from work starting this month,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.36,0:10:01.24,Default,Naomi,0000,0000,0000,,but once the baby gets a little older, she says she'll go back again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.76,0:10:05.41,Default,Naomi,0000,0000,0000,,She says that she wants to leave the baby in the care of Yomogi Nursery again!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.77,0:10:10.91,Default,Naomi,0000,0000,0000,,And since I'm the big sister, I'm going to come and pick the baby up from the Nursery!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.91,0:10:14.42,Default,Naomi,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be able to see you and Miss Sayaka everyday!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.90,0:10:18.93,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I want to see you as a big sister everyday too!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.66,0:10:22.15,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone, let's do our best!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.15,0:10:24.12,Default,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.52,0:11:01.31,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It's gotten really late.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.31,0:11:03.14,Default,CREEPY,0000,0000,0000,,Do you work at Yomogi Nursery?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.84,0:11:05.52,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.67,0:11:10.98,Default,Debt,0000,0000,0000,,That voice... You're the girl who picked up the phone last time?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.42,0:11:13.94,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,You are... ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.30,0:11:23.16,Default,Debt,0000,0000,0000,,The debt collector.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.79,0:11:43.80,Default,Debt,0000,0000,0000,,I'm shutting down the Nursery.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.62,0:11:46.98,Default,Debt,0000,0000,0000,,I won't extend the repayment deadline.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.13,0:11:51.39,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Um... the caller from...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.41,0:11:54.27,Default,Debt,0000,0000,0000,,Working overtime?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.53,0:11:59.13,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,No! I was hanging up posters for the bazaar and just lost track of time—
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.16,0:12:03.53,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh no! You're a bad person; I won't tell you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.53,0:12:05.70,Default,Debt,0000,0000,0000,,You're an interesting one, aren't you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.70,0:12:07.66,Default,Debt,0000,0000,0000,,I thought so when I spoke with you on the phone too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.54,0:12:12.84,Default,Debt,0000,0000,0000,,Did you tell Sayaka for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.85,0:12:16.17,Default,Debt,0000,0000,0000,,That I won't extend the repayment deadline.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.21,0:12:22.17,Default,Debt,0000,0000,0000,,Tell her that I came here today too, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.80,0:12:26.68,Default,Debt,0000,0000,0000,,And that when the deadline comes, I'm destroying the Nursery.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.05,0:12:27.97,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,You can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.53,0:12:30.51,Default,Debt,0000,0000,0000,,Even if there are still kids there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.17,0:12:34.98,Default,Debt,0000,0000,0000,,So if you don't want anyone to get hurt, quickly get out of the way, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.61,0:12:42.70,Default,Debt,0000,0000,0000,,See you, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.08,0:12:59.46,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if he was serious\Nabout destroying the nursery...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.69,0:13:07.47,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,And even if there are still children there... That's just terrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.99,0:13:13.48,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Even though he looks kind, there's something scary about him!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.48,0:13:15.64,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Who would "he" be?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.22,0:13:17.59,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.59,0:13:18.77,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Were you listening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.25,0:13:22.86,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I couldn't help it. You were\Nspeaking to yourself for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.86,0:13:24.40,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I wasn't speaking to my—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.30,0:13:28.66,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,What kind of guy was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.18,0:13:32.72,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I-I didn't ask him for his name... 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.72,0:13:40.04,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,He sort of smiled a lot and called Miss Sayaka "Sayaka" without any titles... 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.33,0:13:41.67,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Okiura, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.06,0:13:47.68,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Do you know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.68,0:13:50.51,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Did Miss Sayaka see him?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.38,0:13:52.75,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.75,0:13:56.55,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,He left after speaking to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.63,0:14:01.96,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Don't tell Miss Sayaka that he came here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.17,0:14:04.17,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.69,0:14:06.53,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,It's fine, just don't say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.60,0:14:17.48,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,What'd you come there for?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.48,0:14:20.54,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,If you make Miss Sayaka cry, I won't forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.27,0:14:25.87,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Got it? Don't you dare show your\Nface in front of Miss Sayaka again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.11,0:14:30.04,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,That man... 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.04,0:14:30.68,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.99,0:14:34.87,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,He's named Okiura, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.39,0:14:38.52,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder how he's related to Miss Sayaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.52,0:14:40.19,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,It's obvious, isn't it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.16,0:14:45.82,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Apparently Sayaka's been married before, and she shares the same last name as that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.19,0:14:48.97,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,He also just calls her Sayaka...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.70,0:14:56.70,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Then that person is Miss Sayaka's husband?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.43,0:15:01.25,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Then why is he trying to shut down the nursery?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.82,0:15:08.76,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Don't get yourself too involved in this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.18,0:15:10.26,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.66,0:15:13.30,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,More importantly, you have\Nsomething you need to do, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.10,0:15:18.61,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,If you don't fill that bottle, you won't be\Nable to get to the place you want to go to.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.27,0:15:23.51,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But... 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.51,0:15:24.98,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.39,0:15:37.62,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,So what have you been stitching over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.86,0:15:39.47,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,A mascot!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.47,0:15:42.16,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm making it out of the cloth I got from Chitose!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.16,0:15:42.87,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.07,0:15:47.28,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Is it a penguin?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.15,0:15:51.05,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It's a bunny... 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.65,0:15:55.64,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Are those supposed to be ears?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.11,0:15:59.53,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It doesn't matter what it is, penguin or otherwise!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.53,0:16:03.15,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'll do my best in order to help make the bazaar successful!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.39,0:16:07.46,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You're gonna mass produce that mysterious lifeform?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.46,0:16:12.95,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,You sound like Fujimoto again! That's so mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.57,0:16:23.25,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,It's rather bleak out today, huh. {overcast}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.25,0:16:24.36,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.36,0:16:24.88,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.41,0:16:27.38,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure it'll clear up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.95,0:16:29.76,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,That'd be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.54,0:16:34.83,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.83,0:16:38.29,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I'll bring something that'll sell really well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.45,0:16:41.40,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.82,0:16:45.55,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Let's do our best all day today!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.55,0:16:46.77,Default,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.19,0:16:54.97,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure the weather fortune dolls will bring good weather for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.76,0:16:56.62,Default,Naomi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.74,0:17:00.47,Default,Yuzuru,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato, no falling, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.47,0:17:02.33,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Cause we're selling drinks and all, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.33,0:17:03.72,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.72,0:17:04.62,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,You will.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.01,0:17:07.00,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I won't, I won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.48,0:17:10.05,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,The two of you get along really well, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.39,0:17:11.96,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.96,0:17:12.71,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,At all!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.73,0:17:15.22,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.14,0:17:17.21,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,You see those?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.21,0:17:20.26,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto brought them here from his workplace.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.88,0:17:31.48,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you... 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.15,0:17:34.49,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,There you go, falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.15,0:17:36.99,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I apologize... 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.40,0:17:40.23,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Don't get too worked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.23,0:17:41.24,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.67,0:17:52.62,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ah! If I don't hurry up—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.10,0:17:57.68,Default,Yuzuru,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato, you ended up falling after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.11,0:18:19.26,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,The customers aren't coming, are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.26,0:18:21.24,Default,Yuzuru,0000,0000,0000,,Even though we hung up posters and everything...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.42,0:18:29.25,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry! Your mothers might still be a little late, but I'm sure other customers will come soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.95,0:18:31.37,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.52,0:18:40.30,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,With things like this, maybe no one will come at all... 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.96,0:18:54.76,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,All because I said something like, "Let's have a bazaar"... 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.89,0:19:02.20,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.15,0:19:05.04,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Chitose!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.82,0:19:09.37,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,I heard about the bazaar from Kobato and I've been looking forward to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.37,0:19:09.84,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.84,0:19:10.33,Default,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.33,0:19:10.71,Default,Chise,0000,0000,0000,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.46,0:19:14.49,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Would you like some yakisoba?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.49,0:19:16.13,Default,Yuzuru,0000,0000,0000,,We have iced coffee too!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.13,0:19:17.67,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,We can also make cafe au lait!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.72,0:19:20.98,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.98,0:19:25.93,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,I really have been looking forward to it. So have Chiho and Chise. But um...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.35,0:19:28.84,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,When I looked around today, I noticed that all the posters had disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.15,0:19:31.82,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,I was afraid this had been canceled.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.82,0:19:32.44,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.10,0:19:35.76,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,How could...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.76,0:19:38.34,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Don't tell me he... 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.68,0:19:41.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.89,0:19:45.08,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to tell everyone that the bazaar hasn't been canceled!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.23,0:19:48.79,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Even if you go and tell them now—!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.04,0:19:50.73,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It's not too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.73,0:19:52.29,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,They still might come!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.29,0:19:55.54,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Even if so, a little bazaar like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.54,0:19:59.05,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Even if it's just one more person, I still want them to come!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.05,0:20:03.09,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I mean... I mean, everyone's worked so hard for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.68,0:20:05.95,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone, all of us together...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.95,0:20:07.06,Default,Naomi,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato... 
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.37,0:20:09.43,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,You feel the same way too, don't you, Fujimoto?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.25,0:20:23.67,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato is a good girl, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.32,0:20:25.45,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,She really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.49,0:20:29.87,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.78,0:20:34.50,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,She said she'd bring people, so at the very least I'll go and prepare coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.11,0:20:37.63,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,Not straightforward, but he's a good kid too, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.14,0:20:39.08,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.73,0:20:46.37,Default,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,A chicken?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.37,0:20:47.47,Default,Chise,0000,0000,0000,,A sunfish? 
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.82,0:20:51.77,Default,Yuzuru,0000,0000,0000,,They really aren't coming, are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.77,0:20:55.42,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Even though it's stopped raining and the sun's coming out...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.57,0:20:59.31,Default,Grandma,0000,0000,0000,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.44,0:21:02.99,Default,Grandma,0000,0000,0000,,Is this the bazaar?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.31,0:21:05.61,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.03,0:21:09.39,Default,Grandma,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato came and told me about it, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.39,0:21:11.12,Default,Grandma,0000,0000,0000,,I came to take a peek.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.20,0:21:16.50,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Am I at the right place?\NI heard there was a bazaar.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.84,0:21:19.50,Default,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if there are any treasures to be found?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.50,0:21:20.22,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Exciting!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.22,0:21:21.55,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Where should we start from?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.21,0:21:23.26,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.04,0:21:29.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How much for yakisoba?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.47,0:21:35.92,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,It's a success, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.92,0:21:36.77,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Domoto... 
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.47,0:21:39.80,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato told me about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.20,0:21:42.78,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Where is she? Has she not come back yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.08,0:21:46.76,Default,Baseballcap,0000,0000,0000,,One iced coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.76,0:21:47.77,Default,Yuzuru,0000,0000,0000,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.77,0:21:49.78,Default,Yuzuru,0000,0000,0000,,Mr. Kiyokazu, iced coffee!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.68,0:21:51.73,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Here you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.29,0:22:00.67,Default,Baseballcap,0000,0000,0000,,{\q2}See, there was this really energetic girl\Nrunning around shouting "Yomogi Nursery Bazaar!"
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.29,0:22:07.32,Default,Baseballcap,0000,0000,0000,,She was so diligent, so I said, "Is that so? Maybe I'll stop by later!"
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.32,0:22:10.50,Default,Baseballcap,0000,0000,0000,,She took my hands and\Npumped them up and down.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.00,0:22:03.24,Default Alt,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Bazaar!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.50,0:22:12.60,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.19,0:22:16.60,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,You can just see it, can't you? That's just like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.73,0:22:21.70,Default,Naomi,0000,0000,0000,,Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.70,0:22:24.15,Default,Mother,0000,0000,0000,,Naomi! I'm sorry for being late.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.57,0:22:26.95,Default,Mother,0000,0000,0000,,There are lots of people here at the bazaar, aren't there?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.26,0:22:28.40,Default,Naomi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.23,0:22:33.28,Default,Mother,0000,0000,0000,,It's great that the weather cleared up, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.68,0:22:38.74,Default,Naomi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.76,0:22:45.30,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yomogi Nursery is having a bazaar!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.30,0:22:50.30,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone, please come by!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.86,0:22:54.97,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yomogi Nursery is having a bazaar!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.97,0:22:57.67,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone, please come by!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.14,0:01:12.94,Title Screen,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(300,0)\pos(340,90)}Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.94,0:01:20.61,Title Screen,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,500)\t(\fscy140\fscx120)\move(340,90,340,45)}Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.18,0:01:15.79,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}How do I do this again?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.08,0:01:20.38,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}The simplest things in life
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.41,0:01:24.39,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}end up being the most difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.62,0:01:27.19,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I just want to smile when I'm happy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.46,0:01:34.53,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}and sing a song whenever I please.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.95,0:01:40.11,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I was told, "Someday,\Nyour dream will come true."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.90,0:01:43.95,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}But when exactly will that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.12,0:01:47.49,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I can't wait that long!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.74,0:01:50.55,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I spread my arms
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.69,0:01:53.29,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}on the count of one two three
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.54,0:01:58.54,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}and gather all the light in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.72,0:02:01.35,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Tell me,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.36,0:02:04.94,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}isn't there something I can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.97,0:02:07.70,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Even if someone hurts my feelings,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.77,0:02:10.44,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I'll keep running toward the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.67,0:02:17.32,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Even if I trip, fall, and cry my eyes out, I still believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.61,0:02:21.33,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Although it may seem silly...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.14,0:02:25.98,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I believe in tomorrow.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:13.18,0:01:15.79,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}How do I do this again?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.08,0:01:20.38,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}The simplest things in life
Dialogue: 1,0:01:21.41,0:01:24.39,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}end up being the most difficult.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.62,0:01:27.19,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}I just want to smile when I'm happy
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.46,0:01:34.53,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}and sing a song whenever I please.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:35.95,0:01:40.11,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}I was told, "Someday,\Nyour dream will come true."
Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.90,0:01:43.95,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}But when exactly will that be?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:44.12,0:01:47.49,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}I can't wait that long!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:47.74,0:01:50.55,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}I spread my arms
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.69,0:01:53.29,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}on the count of one two three
Dialogue: 1,0:01:53.54,0:01:58.54,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}and gather all the light in the world.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:58.72,0:02:01.35,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}Tell me,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:01.36,0:02:04.94,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}isn't there something I can do?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:04.97,0:02:07.70,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}Even if someone hurts my feelings,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:07.77,0:02:10.44,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}I'll keep running toward the light.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:10.67,0:02:17.32,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}Even if I trip, fall, and cry my eyes out, I still believe.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:17.61,0:02:21.33,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}Although it may seem silly...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:22.14,0:02:25.98,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}I believe in tomorrow.
